THIRD-PARTY LICENCES
====================

This file applies to the "-full" builds of Honey, I Shrunk the Vids,
which bundle FFmpeg and FFprobe binaries alongside the application.
The standard builds do not include FFmpeg.


FFmpeg
------

FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), version n8.1.3, is built with --enable-gpl
and --enable-version3 and linked with GPL-licensed libraries (x264 and
x265), so the bundled ffmpeg and ffprobe binaries are distributed under
the GNU General Public Licence version 3 or later (GPLv3+). The full
licence text is in FFMPEG-LICENSE.txt, next to this file (in the Flatpak:
/app/share/licenses/ffmpeg/LICENSE.txt).

The binaries are histv's own static builds. They are compiled from the
unmodified upstream source of FFmpeg and each library below; no patches
are applied. iconv is disabled on every platform, and no library is
picked up from the build machine: only the components named here are
linked.

